# Spanish for Bintana Draw.
#
# The window's own words live in the .form; the canvas's live in the .js. The
# tool names are commands, not prose, but a person reads them, so they are here
# with everything else. Plural forms follow the catalogue's rule, which is why
# the counts are Locale.Plural and not a hand-written if.
